{"availability":"available","full":"InternLM/Intern-Decision","name":"Intern-Decision","description":"Fast multi-modal decision model","category":"Other","language":"Python","stars":809,"forks":27,"created":"2026-09-24T23:37:44Z","updated":"2026-09-29T08:43:55Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"","topics":[],"demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/internlm/intern-decision","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T02:58:04.796Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T02:58:04.796Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T02:58:04.796Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T04:29:22.069Z","stars":717,"forks":29},{"at":"2026-10-17T02:58:04.796Z","stars":809,"forks":27}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["简体中文 · Data interface · Reproduce evaluations","Intern-Decision turns a state, optional images, and multiple typed questions into decisions with probabilities. It fine-tunes the language backbone of Qwen3.5 while freezing the vision tower and projector. Supported question types are choice, score, and noul (yes/no).","This release contains training, two inference backends, benchmark scoring, temperature calibration, and a browser demo. It also includes the 96-case distribution calibration benchmark, its exact references, deterministic generator, and offline scorer, plus the seven accuracy test suites and checkpoint-specific temperature presets. Training data, private calibration/validation records, images, preparation pipelines, and model weights are not included. The runtime schema, tokenization, and collation support your own records. Demo examples are synthetic interface illustrations."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/InternLM/Intern-Decision/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"17015c3ca0bee81ee54fbbb1547d5a0abd6d8dcddbfe61d64a857ede4fb40dba","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T04:29:22.186Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T04:29:22.186Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"简体中文 · Data interf